    affiliation: "University of the People"
year: 2026
version: "3.14"
repository-code: "https://github.com/pinkysworld/redulink-deduplex-quic"
abstract: "ReduLink studies authenticated, scoped reference substitution for redundancy-suppressed transfers over encrypted QUIC streams. The v3.14 artifact adds server-certificate verification, fresh per-run experiment key context, independently validated receive offsets, bounded wire parsing, exact named-object reconstruction, authenticated object boundaries, clean-clone fixture generation, pinned zstd provenance, paired transport summaries, and explicitly bounded localhost/kernel-path claims."
keywords:
  - QUIC
  - redundancy elimination
  - deduplication
  - reference substitution
  - transport protocols
